# Important changes stay

Before changing onboarding, employees, auth, or `create-user`, read [IMPORTANT_CHANGES.md](IMPORTANT_CHANGES.md).

- Keep every behavior listed there. Do not revert a listed decision while doing a different task.
- When a change sets a new rule of that kind, append a dated entry to `IMPORTANT_CHANGES.md`. Do not replace the file or remove older entries.
